E19_CHECK {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.cutoffFrame_transport","strict_definitional_type_check":true,"signature":"∀ {n r : ℕ} (U : Matrix (Fin n) (Fin r) ℝ) (a x z : BfgsVerification.Vec n) (b : ℝ) (τ : ℝ → ℝ),\n  let β := BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.cutoffSlope τ (BfgsVerification.dot a x - b) (BfgsVerification.dot a z - b);\n  BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.cutoffFrame U a (τ (BfgsVerification.dot a z - b)) =\n    BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.cutoffFrame U a (τ (BfgsVerification.dot a x - b)) * 1 +\n        BfgsVerification.EnergyIdentities.rectOuter (z - x) (BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.normalCoefficient β) +\n      BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.cutoffResidual a (z - x) β","contract":"EJob16.Contract06","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
